PaperXI.GluedPacketSections.module_documentation:
Actual linear spaces of compatible sections, their representation, and the
map obtained from root holonomy tests. The final section equivalence is built;
a compatible family of comparison maps is not part of the input.

PaperXI.RamificationSeparation.module_documentation:
Separated local rings and finite faithful automorphism groups have a terminating
lower congruence filtration. This justifies finite support of the conductor sum;
eventual triviality is a theorem, not an assumed cutoff.

PaperXI.TensorIrreducible.module_documentation:
A dimension criterion for irreducibility of an actual central-character
representation. Simplicity proves injectivity of its actual algebra action;
the dimension identity then proves surjectivity and irreducibility.

PaperXI.FreeLatticeCard110.module_documentation:
Cardinality of ideal quotients of an actual finite free module.
This supplies the numerical lattice leaf once its corner basis is constructed;
it does not assert that an arbitrary additive lattice has that basis.

PaperXI.MoritaCartanTransport110.module_documentation:
Actual lattice-index transport under normalizing outer Cartan factors.
The intersection is transported by the additive conjugation equivalence;
relative index is preserved by its proved injectivity.
